    {
      "id": "claim_87fb9c83eff44a1b8f0a795486da0df5",
      "statement": "Production compose docker/compose.yml runs registry, postgres and dex; the registry reads its two secrets and the OTLP header from /run/secrets files, waits for postgres and dex to be healthy, and is health-checked on /healthz; postgres is probed for both databases plus the pg_trgm extension and dex on its /healthz/ready endpoint.",
