    {
      "id": "claim_1c975c078f4e406888302efa4e98aba4",
      "statement": "The Synology LDAP overlay docker/synology-ldap/compose.override.yml is layered on the production compose only: it swaps Dex's config for the LDAP connector variant, adds the ldap_bind_pw secret and LDAP_* variables, and adds an extra_hosts entry on the registry mapping the public hostname to the host's Tailscale IP (hairpin); it cannot be combined with the development compose because that file has no registry service.",
      "evidence": [
